#: ../../Introduction/Challenges.rst:147
msgid ""
"Calculate the required dimensions of the frame to maintain all of the wires "
"in tension"
msgstr ""
"Calcula las dimensiones requeridas del bastidor para mantener todos los "
"cables en tensión"

#: ../../Introduction/Challenges.rst:148
msgid ""
"Fabricate a prototype and explore failure modes that would allow material "
