"`Hydraulic Engineering Lecture on ram pumps "
"<https://github.com/monroews/Hydraulics/raw/master/06_Hydraulic_Transients.pptx>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Conferencia de Ingeniería Hidráulica sobre bombas de ariete "
"<https://github.com/monroews/Hydraulics/raw/master/06_Hydraulic_Transients.pptx>`_"

